<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/up $0.50  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/up $0.50  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady to $0.50 higher, fairly active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Dozen head reputation fed 2-4, 1200 lbs 69.00. Otherwise, Select and Choice 1050-1300 lbs 67.50-68.50. Select 62.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4, 950-1200 lbs 67.00-68.50. Select 62.00-66.50.</p>
</text>
